[ar:Laufey, Albert Beach, Charles Trenet]
[ti:I Wish You Love]
[00:00.24] I wish you bluebirds in the spring
[00:04.78] To give your heart a song to sing
[00:09.13] And then a kiss, but more than this
[00:13.35] I wish you love
[00:17.87] And in July a lemonade
[00:22.51] To cool you in some leafy glade
[00:26.85] I wish you health, and more than wealth
[00:31.15] I wish you love
[00:35.44] My breaking heart and I agree
[00:40.29] That you and I could never be
[00:44.54] So, with my best, my very best
[00:48.89] I set you free
[00:53.32] I wish you shelter from the storm
[00:57.94] A cozy fire to keep you warm
[01:02.48] But most of all, when snowflakes fall
[01:06.85] I wish you love
[01:11.04] 
[01:28.93] I wish you love
[01:32.05] 
